    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1)求表征系统的微分方程;",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            216,
            388,
            235
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)当输入为 $x(t)=e^{-4t}u(t)-te^{-4t}u(t)$ 时,求输出响应。",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            243,
            630,
            263
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {(1)} & {H (w) = \\frac {j w + 4}{(j w) ^ {2} + 5 j w + 6} = \\frac {Y (w)}{X (w)}} \\\\ & {(j w) ^ {2} Y (w) + 5 j w Y (w) + 6 Y (w) = j w X (w) + 4 X (w)} \\\\ {\\therefore} & {y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 5 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 y (t) = x ^ {\\prime} (t) + 4 x (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            150,
            280,
            784,
            454
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(2) \\quad x (w) = \\frac {1}{j w + 4} - \\frac {1}{(j w + 4) ^ {2}} = \\frac {j w + 4 - 1}{(j w + 4) ^ {2}} = \\frac {j w + 3}{(j w + 4) ^ {2}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            473,
            844,
            549
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\therefore Y _ {(W)} = X _ {(W)}, H _ {(W)}} & {= \\frac {j w + 3}{(j w + 4) ^ {2}} \\cdot \\frac {j w + 4}{(j w + 3) (j w + 2)}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{(j w + 2) (j w + 4)}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {\\frac {1}{2}}{j w + 2} + \\frac {- \\frac {1}{2}}{j w + 4}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            165,
            550,
            830,
            782
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore y \\vert t \\vert = \\frac {1}{2} (e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 4 t}) u \\vert t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
