        "text": "$$\nf (t) = \\frac {\\sin 2 \\pi t}{\\pi t} \\cos (2 0 0 0 \\pi t), H (\\omega) = \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} e ^ {- j 2 \\omega} & , | \\omega | <   \\pi \\\\ 0 & , | \\omega | > \\pi \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
