        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{令} ^ {(1)} f _ {1 1 t}} & {= \\frac {\\sin 2 \\pi t}{\\pi t} = 2 \\cdot \\frac {\\sin 2 \\pi t}{2 \\pi t}} \\\\ & {= 2 \\sin (2 \\pi t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
