    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "8、【2024 西安工程大学】",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            84,
            372,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "LTI 系统的幅频响应 $|H(\\omega)|$ 和相频响应 $\\varphi(\\omega)$ 如图所示, 若激励 $f(t)=1+ \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\\cos nt$ , 求该系统的响应 $y(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            112,
            851,
            169
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/d456746fa80670ca6bba599870cbe80d88af404ce8bbdb1f5e70510efdd85ae9.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            236,
            213,
            488,
            330
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(a)",
        "bbox": [
            336,
            335,
            366,
            352
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/a20d7b2ef5e13baa4b2acc4df1ddcf16ae460008197eff3a5bd3a61315cf2f82.jpg",
        "image_caption": [
            "(b)"
        ],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            509,
            184,
            754,
            332
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$Y(w)=F(w)\\cdot H(w)$ 由 $H(w)$ 可知. 只需要关注 $F(w)$ 在 $(-2,2)$ 宽域",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            354,
            937,
            424
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf (t) = 1 + \\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {1}{n} \\cos n t = 1 + \\cos t + \\frac {1}{2} \\cos 2 t + \\dots\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            192,
            431,
            733,
            483
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\therefore$ 在 $\\left( {-2,2}\\right)$ 区域内 $f\\left| t\\right|  = 1 + \\cos t$",
        "bbox": [
            158,
            487,
            576,
            532
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\therefore y (t)} & {= H (1) + | H (1) | \\cos [ t + \\varphi (1) ]} \\\\ & {= 2 + 1 \\cdot \\cos (t - \\frac {\\pi}{2})} \\\\ & {= 2 + \\sin t} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            166,
            539,
            542,
            680
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
